{"id":"n15122-1-7","stage":4,"title":"업종 · 行业","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15122-1-7-1","ko":"요즘 뜨고 있는 업종이 뭐가 있지?","zh":"最近比较火的行业有哪些呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뜨고","meaning":"出名，变红","explanation":"뜨다：出名，变红；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"뜨다","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66028","senseId":"6","lemma":"뜨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"업종이","meaning":"行业","explanation":"업종：行业；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"업종","audio":"/audio/591f543c92f68cab8298.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15122","senseId":"1","lemma":"업종","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있지?","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"83c29e672f4ac6fe","term":"뜨다","zh":"出名，变红","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3","entryId":"66028","definition":"(粗俗)受欢迎而变得有名。","pronunciation":["뜨다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"591f543c92f68cab","term":"업종","zh":"行业","audio":"/audio/591f543c92f68cab8298.mp3","entryId":"15122","definition":"职业或事业的种类。","pronunciation":["업쫑"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/67d6567e955f8f891ed5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15122-1-7-2","ko":"카페 같은 게 괜찮지 않을까?","zh":"咖啡馆之类的怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"카페","meaning":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","explanation":"카페：咖啡店，咖啡馆","readings":[{"term":"카페","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72162","senseId":"1","lemma":"카페","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같은","meaning":"那样的，类似的","explanation":"같다：那样的，类似的；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"3","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"괜찮지","meaning":"没关系，无所谓，可以","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系，无所谓，可以；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않을까?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"53cc9fb21b3694bf","term":"카페","zh":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3","entryId":"72162","definition":"主要销售咖啡、茶、点心等的店铺。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"那样的，类似的","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"表示与某物属于近似的种类。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"没关系，无所谓，可以","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"不用担心或没有问题，可以允许。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/331a4e8ca680c6caca3e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.01,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15122","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":143,"sequenceScore":2.8367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["最近比较火的行业有哪些呢？","咖啡馆之类的怎么样？","最近在忙些什么呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近比较火的行业有哪些呢？","咖啡馆之类的怎么样？","最近在忙些什么呢？"],"answer":1}]}
